{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52065","headline":"久客斋府病归言志 · 王绩","name":"久客斋府病归言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王[邸茅]（据李抄本补）宽，[修]（行）竹正檀栾。\n构山临下杜，穿渠入上兰。\n天人多晏喜，宾宷盛鵷鸾。\n玉舄镇花簟，金环□果盘。\n鬭鷄新市望，走马章台看。\n别有恩光重，恒嗟报答难。\n沉绵赴漳浦，羁旅别长安。\n玄渚芦花白，黄山梨叶丹。\n故人傥相念，应知归路寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}